  "filter-on-desc": "Uri kusefa makadhi pabhodhi iri. Dzvanya pano kuti ugadzirise sefa.",
  "filter-to-selection": "Sefa kuzvasarudzwa",
  "other-filters-label": "Mamwe masefa",
  "advanced-filter-label": "zvepamusoro sefa",
  "advanced-filter-description": "Sefa yepamusoro inokubvumira kunyora tambo ine maoperator anotevera: == != <= >= && || ( ) Nzvimbo isina chinhu inoshandiswa sechiparadzanisi pakati pemaoperator. Unogona kusefa Ndima dzose Dzakagadzirwa nekunyora mazita adzo nemitengo yadzo. Semuenzaniso: Field1 == Value1. Cherechedza: Kana ndima kana mitengo zvine nzvimbo dzisina chinhu, unofanira kuzviisa mukati memacotation mamwe chete. Semuenzaniso: 'Field 1' == 'Value 1'. Kuti mavara ekudzora ega (' \\/) asvetuke, unogona kushandisa \\. Semuenzaniso: Field1 == I\\'m. Unogona zvakare kubatanidza mamiriro akawanda. Semuenzaniso: F1 == V1 || F1 == V2. Kazhinji maoperator ose anoverengwa kubva kuruboshwe kuenda kurudyi. Unogona kuchinja kurongeka nekuisa mabhuraketi. Semuenzaniso: F1 == V1 && ( F2 == V2 || F2 == V3 ). Unogona zvakare kutsvaga ndima dzemashoko uchishandisa regex: F1 == /Tes.*/i",
  "fullname": "Zita rizere",
  "header-logo-title": "Dzokera kupeji yemabhodhi ako.",
  "show-activities": "Ratidza zviitiko",
  "headerBarCreateBoardPopup-title": "Gadzira bhodhi",
  "home": "Kumba",
  "import": "Pinza",
  "impersonate-user": "Zviita semushandisi uyu",
  "link": "Chinongedzo",
  "import-board": "pinza bhodhi",
  "import-board-c": "pinza bhodhi",
  "import-board-instruction-kanboard": "Isa JSON yakaburitswa neKanboard: chinhu chine \"columns\" (kana mabasa ane column_name) nerondedzero \"tasks\" (title, description, column_name, swimlane_name, date_due, owner, tags). Makoramu anova marondedzero uye mabasa anova makadhi.",
  "import-board-instruction-deck": "Isa JSON yebhodhi reNextCloud Deck (bhodhi rine \"stacks\", stack imwe neimwe ine \"cards\" dzayo). MaStack anova marondedzero uye makadhi anova makadhi.",
  "import-board-instruction-openproject": "Isa JSON yeunganidzwa yework-packages yeOpenProject (GET /api/v3/work_packages). Mamiriro anova marondedzero uye work packages dzinova makadhi.",
  "import-board-instruction-issues": "Isa JSON array yenyaya dze__sourceName__ (__endpoint__). Nyaya dzinova makadhi akaiswa mumarondedzero eOpen / Closed.",
  "import-board-instruction-asana": "Isa JSON yemabasa akaburitswa kubva kuAsana ({ \"data\": [...] } kubva pakuburitsa kweAsana kana GET /tasks). Mabasa anoiswa muzvikamu (memberships); mabasa apera anoenda kuDone.",
  "import-board-instruction-zenkit": "Isa JSON yerondedzero yakaburitswa neZenKit ({ \"title\", \"stages\":[...], \"items\":[...] }). Stages dzinova marondedzero uye items dzinova makadhi.",
  "import-board-instruction-trello": "Mubhodhi rako reTrello, enda ku'Menu', wozoti 'More', 'Print and Export', 'Export JSON', wotora mashoko anobuda.",
  "import-board-instruction-csv": "Paste mu yako Comma Separated Values(CSV)/ Tab Separated Values (TSV) .",
  "import-board-instruction-jira": "Namatidza JSON yekutsvaga nyaya muJira Cloud: GET /rest/api/3/search/jql?jql=project=KEY&fields=*all&expand=names,schema (pasina fields inodzosa chete ma-id enyaya). Purojekiti huru inouya nemapeji, rimwe nerimwe rine nextPageToken rinoenda kupeji inotevera: isa nyaya dzemapeji ose murongo mumwe chete we \"issues\", kana kuti pinza peji yega yega sebhodhi rayo pachayo ne Pinza mabhodhi mazhinji. Chinhu chakaenzana { \"issues\": [...] } chinoshandawo. Mamiriro eJira anova marondedzero uye nyaya dzinova makadhi. Kana uchida, isa murongo we \"automationRules\" kuti upinze mitemo.",
  "import-board-instruction-excel": "Sarudza bhuku re.xlsx: tafura ine kadhi rimwe pamutsara wega wega (makoramu akaita seMusoro, Tsanangudzo, Mamiriro/Rondedzero, Nhengo, Mareberu, mazuva neminda yakagadzirwa), kana bhuku rakabuditswa neWeKan, kunyange rine bhodhi rega rega papepa raro. Danho rinotevera rinoratidza kuti koramu ipi ndeye munda upi. Pepa rega rega rine mutsara wemisoro rinova bhodhi.",
  "import-excel-file": "Excel faira (.xlsx)",
  "import-board-instruction-wekan": "Mubhodhi rako, enda ku 'Menyu', wozoenda ku 'Buritsa bhodhi', wokopa mavara ari mufaira rakadhawunirodhwa.",
  "import-board-instruction-about-errors": "Kana ukawana zvikanganiso pakupinza bhodhi, dzimwe nguva kupinza kunenge kwakabudirira, uye bhodhi riri papeji reMabhodhi ese.",
