  "next-page": "inotevera peji",
  "previous-page": "yapfuura peji",
  "heading-notes": "Zvinyorwa",
  "globalSearch-instructions-heading": "Mirayiridzo yekutsvaga",
  "globalSearch-instructions-description": "Kutsvaga kunogona kusanganisira maoperator kuti kuve kwakananga. Maoperator anotaurwa nekunyora zita reoperator nekukosha zvakaparadzaniswa nekoroni. Semuenzaniso, operator `list:Blocked` inoganhura kutsvaga kumakadhi ari murondedzero ine zita rinonzi *Blocked*. Kana kukosha kuine nzvimbo kana mavara akasiyana, kunofanira kuiswa mumakotesheni (semuenzaniso `__operator_list__:\"To Review\"`).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operators": "Mirairo yekutsvaga iripo:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-board": "`__operator_board__:<title>` - makadhi ari mumabhodhi anoenderana ne *<title>* yataurwa",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-list": "`__operator_list__:<title>` - makadhi ari mumarondedzero anoenderana ne *<title>* yataurwa",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-swimlane": "`__operator_swimlane__:<title>` - makadhi ari mumigwagwa inoenderana ne *<title>* yataurwa",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-comment": "`__operator_comment__:<text>` - makadhi ane mhinduro ine *<text>*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-label": "`__operator_label__:<color>` `__operator_label__:<name>` - makadhi ane reberu inoenderana ne *<color>* kana *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-hash": "`__operator_label_abbrev__<name|color>` - nzira pfupi ye `__operator_label__:<color>` kana `__operator_label__:<name>`",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-user": "`__operator_user__:<username>` - makadhi apo *<username>* iri *nhengo* kana *akapihwa basa*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-at": "`__operator_user_abbrev__username` - nzira pfupi ye `user:<username>`",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-member": "`__operator_member__:<username>` - makadhi apo *<username>* iri *nhengo*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-assignee": "`__operator_assignee__:<username>` - makadhi apo *<username>* ari *akapihwa basa*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-creator": "`__operator_creator__:<username>` - makadhi ane *<username>* ari iye akagadzira kadhi",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-org": "`__operator_org__:<display name|short name>` - makadhi ebhodhi rakapihwa sangano *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-team": "`__operator_team__:<display name|short name>` - makadhi ebhodhi rakapihwa chikwata *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-due": "`__operator_due__:<n>` - makadhi anofanira kupera mukati memazuva *<n>* kubva zvino.  `__operator_due__:__predicate_overdue__ inonyora makadhi ose apfuura zuva rawo rekupedzisira.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-created": "`__operator_created__:<n>` - makadhi akagadzirwa mazuva *<n>* apfuura kana mashoma",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-modified": "`__operator_modified__:<n>` - makadhi akachinjwa mazuva *<n>* apfuura kana mashoma",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-status": "`__operator_status__:<status>` - apo *<status>* iri imwe yeizvi:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-archived": "`__predicate_archived__` - zvakachengetwa makadhi",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-all": "`__predicate_all__` - makadhi ose, ari mudura nemasiri mudura",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-ended": "`__predicate_ended__` - makadhi ane zuva rekuguma",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-public": "`__predicate_public__` - makadhi chete mu zveruzhinji mabhodhi",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-private": "`__predicate_private__` - makadhi chete mu zvakavanzika mabhodhi",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-has": "`__operator_has__:<field>` - apo *<field>* iri imwe ye `__predicate_attachment__`, `__predicate_checklist__`, `__predicate_description__`, `__predicate_start__`, `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_end__`, `__predicate_assignee__` kana `__predicate_member__`.  Kuisa `-` pamberi pe *<field>* kunotsvaga makadhi asina kukosha mundima iyoyo (semuenzaniso `has:-due` inotsvaga makadhi asina zuva rekupedzisira).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-sort": "`__operator_sort__:<sort-name>` - apo *<sort-name>* iri imwe ye `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_created__` kana `__predicate_modified__`.  Kuti urongedze zvichidzika, isa `-` pamberi pezita rekurongedza.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-limit": "`__operator_limit__:<n>` - apo *<n>* inhamba yakazara iri pamusoro pe zero inoratidza kuti makadhi mangani anoratidzwa papeji imwe neimwe.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-1": "Maoperator akawanda anogona kutaurwa.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-2": "Maoperator akafanana anobatanidzwa ne *OR*.  Makadhi anoenderana nechero chimwe chezvinodiwa anodzoserwa.\n`__operator_list__:Available __operator_list__:Blocked` yaizodzosa makadhi ari murondedzero ipi neipi ine zita rinonzi *Blocked* kana *Available*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3": "Maoperator akasiyana anobatanidzwa ne *AND*.  Makadhi anoenderana nemaoperator ose akasiyana chete ndiwo anodzoserwa.  `__operator_list__:Available __operator_label__:red` inodzosa chete makadhi ari murondedzero *Available* ane reberu *red*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3-2": "Mazuva anogona kunyorwa senhamba yakazara yakanaka kana isina kunaka, kana kushandisa `__predicate_week__`, `__predicate_month__`, `__predicate_quarter__` kana `__predicate_year__` kuchinguva chiripo.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-4": "Kutsvaga mashoko hakusiyanisi mavara makuru nemaduku.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-5": "Sezvakajairwa makadhi ari mudura haatsvagwi.",
