  "gcs-permissions-note": "Ipa akaundi yesevhisi yeWeKan mvumo yekuverenga nekunyora mubucket: Google Cloud Console → Cloud Storage → Buckets → bucket yako → Permissions → Grant access. Mu \"New principals\", namatidza email yeakaundi yesevhisi — ukoshi hwe \"client_email\" hunobva mukiyi yako yeJSON — wobva wasarudza basa rekuti \"Storage Object Admin\" wodzvanya Save.",
