  "s3-bucket-menu-path": "AWS Console → S3 → Buckets → yako bucket zita (kana gadzira bucket → Bucket zita).",
  "s3-access-key-menu-path": "AWS Console → IAM → Users → mushandisi wako → Security credentials → Access keys → Create access key → sarudza use case 'Application running outside AWS' → Create access key. Inoratidzwa se'Access key ID'.",
  "s3-secret-key-menu-path": "Pachiratidziro chimwe chete neAccess key ID; 'Secret access key' inoratidzwa kamwe chete chete kana kiyi yagadzirwa — ikopa ipapo (kana dzvanya Download .csv).",
  "azure-account-name-menu-path": "Azure Portal → Storage accounts → akaundi yako → zita rinoratidzwa kumusoro (zvakare pasi pe Security + networking → Access keys → Storage account name).",
  "azure-account-key-menu-path": "Azure Portal → Storage accounts → yako akaundi → chengetedzo + networking → Access keys → key1 → ratidza → Key.",
  "azure-connection-string-menu-path": "Azure Portal → Storage accounts → yako akaundi → chengetedzo + networking → Access keys → key1 → Connection string → ratidza.",
  "azure-container-menu-path": "Azure Portal → Storage accounts → akaundi yako → Data storage → Containers → container yako (kana + Container kuti ugadzire imwe).",
  "gcs-project-id-menu-path": "Google Cloud Console → musarudzi weprojekti kumusoro → ID yeprojekti yako (Cloud overview → Dashboard → Project info → Project ID).",
  "gcs-bucket-menu-path": "Google Cloud Console → Cloud Storage → Buckets → zita rebucket rako (kana Create kuti ugadzire imwe).",
  "gcs-key-filename-menu-path": "Nzira pasevha yeWeKan inoenda kufaira rekiyi yeJSON reakaundi yesevhisi rawadhaunirodha (rinogadzirwa pazasi). Shandisa izvi KANA namatidza JSON mundima iri pazasi.",
  "gcs-credentials-menu-path": "Google Cloud Console → IAM & Admin → Service accounts → akaundi yako yesevhisi → Keys → Add key → Create new key → JSON → Create (inodhaunirodha faira). Namatidza zviri mukati maro pano, kana chengeta faira wogadza nzira yaro pamusoro.",
