  "run-delete-duplicate-empty-lists-migration-confirm": "Izvi zvichatanga zvachinja marondedzero ese anogovaniswa kuita marondedzero emugwagwa mumwe nemumwe, zvobva zvadzima marondedzero asina chinhu ane rondedzero yakapetwa ine musoro wakafanana ine makadhi. Marondedzero asina chinhu asingadiwe chaizvo chete ndiwo achabviswa. Kuenderera mberi here?",
